{
    "version": "2.8.8",
    "description": "极简dock栏，专注于Windows端dock的软件",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/wang01116/MiniDock",
    "license": "unknown",
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/wang01116/MiniDock",
        "tag_regex": "^v([\\d.]+)$"
    },
    "url": "https://github.com/wang01116/MiniDock/releases/download/v2.8.8/MiniDock-2.8.8.exe",
    "hash": "sha256:ef17526da46fb6fc66b2a70d4894e523f8df320505f33b7be97421794090192e",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/wang01116/MiniDock/releases/download/v$version/MiniDock-$version.exe"
    },
    "pre_install": "$e = Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\MiniDock*.exe\" | Select-Object -First 1; if ($e -and $e.Name -ne 'MiniDock.exe') { Rename-Item -Path $e.FullName -NewName 'MiniDock.exe' -Force }",
    "bin": "MiniDock.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "MiniDock.exe",
            "MiniDock"
        ]
    ],
    "notes": [
        "上游 2.8.8 起资产名改回带版本号（MiniDock-$version.exe）→ pre_install 安装时重命名为固定名 MiniDock.exe，bin/shortcuts 不随版本漂移。",
        "同 release 的 *-source.zip 是源码包；*-UPX.zip 为 UPX 压缩版（体积更小，易被杀软误报），本清单取未压缩版。"
    ]
}
